     "email_subject": "Complete your purchase: your website will thank you!",
     "email_pre_header": "Everything you picked is still in your cart 🛒",
     "email_body": "<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"primary\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-primary-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":881668,\"width\":\"200px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com\"><img src=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/logo-5.png\" alt=\"GravityKit\" class=\"wp-image-881668\" style=\"width:200px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"filter-md\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-filter-md-font-size\">Hi {{contact.first_name|there}},</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Did you forget to check out? Your cart is saved, so you can pick up right where you left off.&nbsp;🛒</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here is what you left in your cart:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n{{ab_cart_edd.cart_items_table}}\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#1877f2\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"##ab_cart_edd.recovery_url##\" style=\"background-color:#1877f2\">Return and Complete Purchase</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A refresher: GravityKit turns your Gravity Forms entries into the things people keep asking you for. A member directory. A dashboard your team can log in to. A report your boss can open and share. You build it yourself, without hiring a developer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not sure it does what you need? Reply and let me know. I’ll give you honest feedback about whether GravityKit is the right fit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"##ab_cart_edd.recovery_url##\">Go back and complete your purchase.</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Zack Katz<br>Founder, GravityKit</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>P.S. Not sure which plugins you need? <a href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/consultation/\">Book a free 1-on-1 call with me</a> and we’ll work it out together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>P.P.S. Every purchase comes with a 30-day guarantee: if GravityKit doesn’t do what you need, tell us within 30 days of buying and we’ll refund you in full.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"gk-cart-stop\" style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\">Don’t want these reminders? <a href=\"##ab_cart_edd.stop_url##\">Stop these emails</a>.</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n",
