     "email_pre_header": "Try it on a live demo before you buy.",
     "email_body": "<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"primary\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-primary-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":881668,\"width\":\"200px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com\"><img src=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/logo-5.png\" alt=\"GravityKit\" class=\"wp-image-881668\" style=\"width:200px\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"filter-md\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-filter-md-font-size\">Hi {{contact.first_name|there}},</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You still have {{ab_cart_edd.product_names}} in your cart.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you’re not sure GravityKit will do what you need, here are three ways to find out before you pay:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://site.try.gravitykit.com/\">Try it on a live demo site.</a></strong> Build with real form entries, nothing to install.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Let me know.</strong> Reply to this email and I’ll tell you whether it fits and which plugins you need.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Talk it through with me.</strong> <a href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/consultation/\">Book a free 1-on-1 call</a> and we’ll work it out together.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every week you wait is another week of copying entries into spreadsheets, sending people the latest list by hand, and logging in to the WordPress dashboard to find the one entry someone asked about.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#1877f2\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"##ab_cart_edd.recovery_url##\" style=\"background-color:#1877f2\">Go Back and Complete Your Purchase</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Zack Katz<br>Founder, GravityKit</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>P.S. Every purchase comes with a 30-day guarantee: if GravityKit doesn’t do what you need, tell us within 30 days of buying and we’ll refund you in full.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"gk-cart-stop\" style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\">Don’t want these reminders? <a href=\"##ab_cart_edd.stop_url##\">Stop these emails</a>.</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n",
